	"version"		"3"
	"revision"		"1"
	"title"		"ROB RUN PRO - DualSense"
	"description"		"Built from the game's own key bindings. Three control modes: On Foot, Driving (R2 gas, L2 brake) and Helicopter. Hold TRIANGLE to get in or out of a vehicle, hold OPTIONS to change mode by hand. Hold L1 for the second row of actions. No macros."
